#! rate=44118 block=128 tracks=4
# 01 Clock and tempo (docs/13 R1, R2).
# The integer accumulator; F8 on every fourth master tick; Start on the first
# block that plays, Stop on the falling edge. Tempo changes keep the
# accumulator; out-of-range tempos clamp to 20.00..300.00 BPM. Tick 0 fires
# one tick period after Play, not at it.
# D1 trace: no D2-D7 behaviour is involved, so the FM-1 default mode should
# produce <stem>.d1.jsonl: the same events, each tick at its own frame.
@0 tog 0 0 60 100
@0 tog 0 4 62 100
@0 tog 0 8 64 100
@0 tog 0 12 65 100
@0 bpm 13333
@0 play
@20000 bpm 30000
@26000 bpm 999999
@30000 bpm 2000
@33000 bpm -5
@36000 bpm 18733
@70000 stop
@72000 bpm 9000
@74000 play
@96000 stop
